# Source: Gilly1970/Gemtek-W1700K-6.18 openwrt-patches/045 (2026-09-10), 论坛 t/249319 #441 发布
#   https://github.com/Gilly1970/Gemtek-W1700K-6.18/blob/main/openwrt-patches/045-wifi-mt76-mt7996-refresh-tx-agg-timer-under-npu-offload.patch
# Upstream: n/a（mt76 上游无对应提交；openwrt/mt76 master be5ce791 中该门仍只判 WED）
# Reason: NPU offload 下 TX block-ack 会话定时器无人刷新 —— 对端（Intel 站点常见）
#   协商 BlockAck timeout 后，传输中途 DELBA，吞吐塌到未聚合速率且不自恢复，直到
#   无关流量走软件路径才恢复；社区实测"单个 ping 包即恢复、持续 ping 则全程正常"
#   （论坛 t/222776 #3900/#3901、t/249319 #440～#442）。mt7996_mac_add_txs_skb() 是
#   全驱动唯一刷新点（grep ieee80211_refresh_tx_agg_session_timer 仅 1 处），其门为
#   mtk_wed_device_active()；NPU 路径（mt76_npu_device_active()）被排除在门之外。
#   本补丁把门扩为 WED || NPU，与 WED 路径行为一致。
# 机制前提（待实机确认，见 docs/absorptions/2026-09-11-absorption-plan.md §待验证）：
#   NPU 卸载下 PKT_TYPE_TXS 是否仍上报到 host（若非，则本补丁是 no-op，需把刷新
#   挪到 NPU TXFREE 路径 —— Gilly 自己亦在论坛提示此退路）。应用后以
#   "Samba/大文件 + Intel 客户端吞吐是否仍塌陷"为判据。
# 验证：已对 openwrt/mt76 be5ce7910521492d4a2e4ce7ee3843680a46c047 真实应用通过
#   （patch -p1：Hunk #1 succeeded at 1508, offset -3 行）；符号 mt76_npu_device_active()
#   在同版本 mt76.h 中定义（1760 行）且 mt7996/mac.c 已含其它 NPU 分支，可见性无问题。
From: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: refresh the tx agg session timer under NPU offload

On boards using Airoha NPU offload, TX block-ack sessions get torn down mid-transfer
whenever the peer negotiates a BlockAck timeout (Intel stations commonly do). Offloaded
traffic bypasses mac80211, so nothing refreshes the session timer - the driver only did
that for WED devices, and the NPU path was gated out. The result is a DELBA in the middle
of a transfer and throughput collapsing to un-aggregated rates, with no recovery until
unrelated traffic happens to take the software path. Extending the gate to cover NPU
devices keeps the session alive the same way it already works on WED.

Signed-off-by: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
---
--- a/mt7996/mac.c
+++ b/mt7996/mac.c
@@ -1511,7 +1511,8 @@
 		}
 	}
 
-	if (mtk_wed_device_active(&dev->mt76.mmio.wed) && wcid->sta) {
+	if ((mtk_wed_device_active(&dev->mt76.mmio.wed) ||
+	     mt76_npu_device_active(&dev->mt76)) && wcid->sta) {
 		struct ieee80211_sta *sta;
 		u8 tid;
 
